  <!-- Headline -->
  <h2>What Actually Makes AloSIM Different</h2>
  <p>
    Most eSIM apps sell you data and nothing else. AloSIM bundles in a free international phone number through a partnership with Hushed, the second-line-number app. It's not a full replacement for your regular number (you set it up separately inside the AloSIM app after buying a plan), but it's a genuine point of difference: if you need a number to receive a verification text or give out to a hotel abroad without handing over your real one, most competitors on this site don't offer anything like it.
  </p>
  <p>
    AloSIM also sells both fixed-data and unlimited plans, rather than picking one model the way <a href="/airalo/">Airalo</a> (pay-per-GB only) or <a href="/holafly/">Holafly</a> (unlimited only) do. That gives you the choice on their own site instead of having to compare across providers to get it.
  </p>

