  <!-- FAQ -->
  <h2>AloSIM Promo Code FAQ</h2>
  <div class="content-faq">
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>What is the best code right now</h3>
      <p><strong>ALOSAVE</strong>: 15% off all AloSIM plans, fixed-GB or unlimited.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does AloSIM include a phone number</h3>
      <p>It can. AloSIM partners with Hushed to offer a free international phone number, set up separately inside the AloSIM app after you buy a plan. It's a second line for calls or texts, not a swap for your existing number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Can I get a refund if the eSIM doesn't work</h3>
      <p>Yes, AloSIM advertises a refund for eSIMs that fail to connect or turn out incompatible with your device. That guarantee applies before you've made real use of the data, so don't activate a plan until you're ready to actually use it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Does an unused AloSIM plan expire</h3>
      <p>No. You can buy ahead of a trip and the eSIM sits unused until you install and activate it, so buying early doesn't cost you data.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-faq-item">
      <h3>Fixed data or unlimited, which should I pick</h3>
      <p>If you can estimate your usage, a fixed-GB plan is usually cheaper. If you'd rather not track a data meter, AloSIM's unlimited plans cover that without switching to a different provider.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

